      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `88a0a9d386567a3cc70f68e1f3996c031f23073372ab08e3feb1c36834f7f416--45300do001_201011.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 81ff685f3ee5de9f96de9f5f982e8b00310a8ea3de03d2f31d3934cc37eac481 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 7740f0e3e4c4fe997bf39f02b51e8cb3bbf27f8640b86711729d69e35c9063cf | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | c36f6c0c0a900147ca06aa384b194aa71826331da5501ebd49dce02406389726 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 00c3dc4bf0758e38c67339d15bb308ca164ea980d1ac351d6bddcfb4067feb5e | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | e128a1f14ea2b80a00273e6f80455db73c24111aa6533d19da205d7295119d8e | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 8329bd9d4e00cdd5b6c08d5df38d148bc2eefbbb837cfd12b5e86365eef0a215 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | de8e2f3f7eeaba6cb07783362f759618000e6c3a85a0d6fd727fca11e946f475 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | ca0038fb75ac3a2c9875fa9083a4089b1f72d7c31654b810270d464ec30c726b | missing |\n| \"Table 4a\" | 2be324daf227a0baa92d091e0eb88f452a55ce93be0623ab95281609264c695f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
